- Ask: Which interpretation is correct?
  - Is $72k the net monthly cash burn (cash outflows minus cash inflows)?
  - Is the $2.4M last quarter recurring revenue and is it cash collected (not bookings/ACV/recognized revenue with long collections)?
  - Are there known one-time inflows/outflows not included (debt repayments, capex, customer refunds, large deferred revenue usage)?

