- Expected monthly revenue (or % growth month-over-month)
- Cash collection lag (days sales outstanding)
- Monthly operating cash outflows (or categories: payroll, rent, marketing, other)
- One-time items (debt repayments, taxes, capex)
If you want, I’ll build a simple model using conservative assumptions and show ending cash each month and runway under the three scenarios above.

7) Recommended KPIs to report monthly
- Cash balance (headline)
- Net cash burn (cash outflow minus inflow)
- Runway (months)
- Revenue run-rate and month-over-month growth
- Gross margin and operating margin (if relevant)
- Days Sales Outstanding (DSO) / AR ageing
- Deferred revenue and customer concentration

8) Suggested next steps for you right now
