- To investors/board: "We closed the quarter with healthy top-line momentum ($2.4M) and a disciplined cost base. Our current cash is $1.2M; at the current net cash burn, we have runway in the mid-teens of months. We are implementing targeted actions to extend runway while preserving growth investments."
- To internal teams: "Revenue performance is strong and validates product-market fit. We’ll ask teams to prioritize projects with clear ROI and temporarily defer lower-impact initiatives so we maintain healthy runway."

