- Risks & mitigations: “Key risk is collection/recognition mismatch and large one-time spend. Mitigations: tighten collections, defer non-critical hires/capex, accelerate high-margin deals, or secure a small bridge facility if needed.”

Simple sensitivity examples (illustrative)
- If net burn = $72K → runway ≈ 16.7 months.
- If net burn = $40K → runway = 30 months (matches your stated runway).
- If net burn = $0 (break-even) → cash runway is effectively unlimited (you’d be cash-flow neutral).
- If net burn rises to $100K (worse case) → runway = $1.2M / $100K = 12 months.

