Executive summary
“We report $1.2M cash and an effective monthly net cash draw of ~ $40K, implying ~30 months of runway. This runway reflects current operating spending and committed revenue/capital expectations and allows for measured investment in growth while maintaining a conservative liquidity buffer.”

