4. Any committed funding, upcoming large receipts, or one-time payments planned in the next 12 months.
5. Preferred projection horizon (12 or 24 months) and whether to model hiring scenarios.

If you confirm the key points above, I’ll produce the projection and a tight narrative/slide you can drop into your board pack. Which scenario is the real one, and do you want a 12- or 24-month projection?

